          "desc": "The group arrives at Kilimanjaro Airport (JRO). Participants are met by a representative of Black Eagle tours and transferred to a hotel in Arusha.\n\nAccommodation:\nMeal Plan: Breakfast included\nAmenities: Air Conditioner, Gym, Laundry service, Restaurant, Spa, Swimming Pool, WiFi"
